[[:db/add "63d5ce41-5e6c-502a-a5d4-935d0524bb33" :answer/id #uuid "63d5ce41-5e6c-502a-a5d4-935d0524bb33"] [:db/add "63d5ce41-5e6c-502a-a5d4-935d0524bb33" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "63d5ce41-5e6c-502a-a5d4-935d0524bb33" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 z + 1 \\\\ - 3 z - 3 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "63d5ce41-5e6c-502a-a5d4-935d0524bb33" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4f285e12-e8b4-559e-88c8-dab4e092143b" :answer/id #uuid "4f285e12-e8b4-559e-88c8-dab4e092143b"] [:db/add "4f285e12-e8b4-559e-88c8-dab4e092143b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4f285e12-e8b4-559e-88c8-dab4e092143b" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 z - 4 \\\\ - 3 z - 3 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "4f285e12-e8b4-559e-88c8-dab4e092143b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8cb40c88-ef2a-5490-807a-fe2ae22731e1" :answer/id #uuid "8cb40c88-ef2a-5490-807a-fe2ae22731e1"] [:db/add "8cb40c88-ef2a-5490-807a-fe2ae22731e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8cb40c88-ef2a-5490-807a-fe2ae22731e1" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 - z \\\\ - 3 z \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "8cb40c88-ef2a-5490-807a-fe2ae22731e1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8ba46e06-bd1f-572c-aa28-caf9ad114ce2" :answer/id #uuid "8ba46e06-bd1f-572c-aa28-caf9ad114ce2"] [:db/add "8ba46e06-bd1f-572c-aa28-caf9ad114ce2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8ba46e06-bd1f-572c-aa28-caf9ad114ce2" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}z + 1 \\\\ 2 z - 3 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "8ba46e06-bd1f-572c-aa28-caf9ad114ce2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0fe195cc-c1c9-57ab-bd05-53d84ab8c2d5" :answer/id #uuid "0fe195cc-c1c9-57ab-bd05-53d84ab8c2d5"] [:db/add "0fe195cc-c1c9-57ab-bd05-53d84ab8c2d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0fe195cc-c1c9-57ab-bd05-53d84ab8c2d5" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 z - 4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "0fe195cc-c1c9-57ab-bd05-53d84ab8c2d5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e" :answer-field/id #uuid "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e"] [:db/add "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e" :answer-field/choices "63d5ce41-5e6c-502a-a5d4-935d0524bb33"] [:db/add "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e" :answer-field/choices "4f285e12-e8b4-559e-88c8-dab4e092143b"] [:db/add "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e" :answer-field/choices "8cb40c88-ef2a-5490-807a-fe2ae22731e1"] [:db/add "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e" :answer-field/choices "8ba46e06-bd1f-572c-aa28-caf9ad114ce2"] [:db/add "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e" :answer-field/choices "0fe195cc-c1c9-57ab-bd05-53d84ab8c2d5"] [:db/add "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e" :answer-field/correct "0fe195cc-c1c9-57ab-bd05-53d84ab8c2d5"] [:db/ensure "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0cacab16-5025-56cd-add8-719e8ed1c3e5" :question/id #uuid "0cacab16-5025-56cd-add8-719e8ed1c3e5"] [:db/add "0cacab16-5025-56cd-add8-719e8ed1c3e5" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x + 2 y + 3 z &=4 \\\\ - 3 x - 6 y - 9 z &=-12 \\\\ 2 x + 5 y + 6 z &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "0cacab16-5025-56cd-add8-719e8ed1c3e5" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ -3 & -6 & -9 & -12 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 6 & 12\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nFirst reduce the matrix to row echelon form, making each pivot equal to $1$.\n\n$$\nR_{2}:=R_{2}+\\left(3\\right)R_{1}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 6 & 12\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_{3}:=R_{3}+\\left(-2\\right)R_{1}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_{2}\\leftrightarrow R_{3}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nIn the row echelon form above, we have only two pivots (in the $1$st and $2$nd columns). To transform the matrix to reduced row echelon form, we need to create zeros above the pivots only.\n\n$$\nR_{1}:=R_{1}+\\left(-2\\right)R_{2}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x + 3 z &=-4 \\\\ y &=4 \\\\ 0 &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe final equation is $0=0$, so it imposes no restriction. The basic variables are $x$ and $y$, and the free variable is $z$. Find $x$ and $y$ in terms of $z$. Therefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=- 3 z - 4 \\\\ y &=4 \\\\ z &=z\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $z$ is an arbitrary real number. In vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 z - 4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "0cacab16-5025-56cd-add8-719e8ed1c3e5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "0cacab16-5025-56cd-add8-719e8ed1c3e5" :question/answer-fields "768bc7fc-8beb-55fa-8267-e4b53c276b0e"] [:db/ensure "0cacab16-5025-56cd-add8-719e8ed1c3e5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096745 :knowledge-point/questions "0cacab16-5025-56cd-add8-719e8ed1c3e5"] [:db/add "7990b9a4-42a4-556b-a05d-54b79e13a18c" :answer/id #uuid "7990b9a4-42a4-556b-a05d-54b79e13a18c"] [:db/add "7990b9a4-42a4-556b-a05d-54b79e13a18c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7990b9a4-42a4-556b-a05d-54b79e13a18c" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 z + 2 \\\\ 3 z - 4 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "7990b9a4-42a4-556b-a05d-54b79e13a18c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "443c49ec-d469-50f9-b2c3-70042d90ed20" :answer/id #uuid "443c49ec-d469-50f9-b2c3-70042d90ed20"] [:db/add "443c49ec-d469-50f9-b2c3-70042d90ed20" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "443c49ec-d469-50f9-b2c3-70042d90ed20" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 - 2 z \\\\ -1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "443c49ec-d469-50f9-b2c3-70042d90ed20" :answer/validate] [:db/add "34538a27-2383-50e7-8076-c682311a9c60" :answer/id #uuid "34538a27-2383-50e7-8076-c682311a9c60"] [:db/add "34538a27-2383-50e7-8076-c682311a9c60" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "34538a27-2383-50e7-8076-c682311a9c60" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 - 3 z \\\\ - 3 z - 4 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "34538a27-2383-50e7-8076-c682311a9c60" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0484bdd4-940e-5a70-b74f-e563031ff8a5" :answer/id #uuid "0484bdd4-940e-5a70-b74f-e563031ff8a5"] [:db/add "0484bdd4-940e-5a70-b74f-e563031ff8a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0484bdd4-940e-5a70-b74f-e563031ff8a5" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 z + 4 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "0484bdd4-940e-5a70-b74f-e563031ff8a5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c35d86cd-f077-5ff6-aae9-8a90fe7cd4dd" :answer/id #uuid "c35d86cd-f077-5ff6-aae9-8a90fe7cd4dd"] [:db/add "c35d86cd-f077-5ff6-aae9-8a90fe7cd4dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c35d86cd-f077-5ff6-aae9-8a90fe7cd4dd" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}z \\\\ z + 4 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "c35d86cd-f077-5ff6-aae9-8a90fe7cd4dd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3" :answer-field/id #uuid "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3"] [:db/add "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3" :answer-field/choices "7990b9a4-42a4-556b-a05d-54b79e13a18c"] [:db/add "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3" :answer-field/choices "443c49ec-d469-50f9-b2c3-70042d90ed20"] [:db/add "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3" :answer-field/choices "34538a27-2383-50e7-8076-c682311a9c60"] [:db/add "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3" :answer-field/choices "0484bdd4-940e-5a70-b74f-e563031ff8a5"] [:db/add "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3" :answer-field/choices "c35d86cd-f077-5ff6-aae9-8a90fe7cd4dd"] [:db/add "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3" :answer-field/correct "7990b9a4-42a4-556b-a05d-54b79e13a18c"] [:db/ensure "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2a33b689-5dc0-5282-8917-dcef39d41db8" :question/id #uuid "2a33b689-5dc0-5282-8917-dcef39d41db8"] [:db/add "2a33b689-5dc0-5282-8917-dcef39d41db8" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x + 2 y - 9 z &=-6 \\\\ - 3 x - 6 y + 27 z &=18 \\\\ 2 x + 5 y - 21 z &=-16\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "2a33b689-5dc0-5282-8917-dcef39d41db8" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -9 & -6 \\\\ -3 & -6 & 27 & 18 \\\\ 2 & 5 & -21 & -16\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nFirst reduce the matrix to row echelon form, making each pivot equal to $1$.\n\n$$\nR_{2}:=R_{2}+\\left(3\\right)R_{1}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -9 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 5 & -21 & -16\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_{3}:=R_{3}+\\left(-2\\right)R_{1}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -9 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -4\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_{2}\\leftrightarrow R_{3}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & -9 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nIn the row echelon form above, we have only two pivots (in the $1$st and $2$nd columns). To transform the matrix to reduced row echelon form, we need to create zeros above the pivots only.\n\n$$\nR_{1}:=R_{1}+\\left(-2\\right)R_{2}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x - 3 z &=2 \\\\ y - 3 z &=-4 \\\\ 0 &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe final equation is $0=0$, so it imposes no restriction. The basic variables are $x$ and $y$, and the free variable is $z$. Find $x$ and $y$ in terms of $z$. Therefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=3 z + 2 \\\\ y &=3 z - 4 \\\\ z &=z\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $z$ is an arbitrary real number. In vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 z + 2 \\\\ 3 z - 4 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "2a33b689-5dc0-5282-8917-dcef39d41db8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "2a33b689-5dc0-5282-8917-dcef39d41db8" :question/answer-fields "3e58c1ee-8604-5c87-8c64-38b2792b8ee3"] [:db/ensure "2a33b689-5dc0-5282-8917-dcef39d41db8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096745 :knowledge-point/questions "2a33b689-5dc0-5282-8917-dcef39d41db8"] [:db/add "1201f8a0-8495-5147-b800-2b7eb5663d43" :answer/id #uuid "1201f8a0-8495-5147-b800-2b7eb5663d43"] [:db/add "1201f8a0-8495-5147-b800-2b7eb5663d43" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1201f8a0-8495-5147-b800-2b7eb5663d43" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/ensure "1201f8a0-8495-5147-b800-2b7eb5663d43" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0695697b-3fc8-5062-8203-f0b5c7160dec" :answer/id #uuid "0695697b-3fc8-5062-8203-f0b5c7160dec"] [:db/add "0695697b-3fc8-5062-8203-f0b5c7160dec" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0695697b-3fc8-5062-8203-f0b5c7160dec" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/ensure "0695697b-3fc8-5062-8203-f0b5c7160dec" :answer/validate] [:db/add "464d337c-a804-57b2-882d-f4c6b2e9fd95" :answer/id #uuid "464d337c-a804-57b2-882d-f4c6b2e9fd95"] [:db/add "464d337c-a804-57b2-882d-f4c6b2e9fd95" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "464d337c-a804-57b2-882d-f4c6b2e9fd95" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/ensure "464d337c-a804-57b2-882d-f4c6b2e9fd95" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a6fbb00f-6279-5bf5-b2b1-0b64c6acf7cd" :answer/id #uuid "a6fbb00f-6279-5bf5-b2b1-0b64c6acf7cd"] [:db/add "a6fbb00f-6279-5bf5-b2b1-0b64c6acf7cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a6fbb00f-6279-5bf5-b2b1-0b64c6acf7cd" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/ensure "a6fbb00f-6279-5bf5-b2b1-0b64c6acf7cd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ac3c879a-436c-5983-88b7-5ba7d1b5b9c3" :answer/id #uuid "ac3c879a-436c-5983-88b7-5ba7d1b5b9c3"] [:db/add "ac3c879a-436c-5983-88b7-5ba7d1b5b9c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ac3c879a-436c-5983-88b7-5ba7d1b5b9c3" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/ensure "ac3c879a-436c-5983-88b7-5ba7d1b5b9c3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c" :answer-field/id #uuid "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c"] [:db/add "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c" :answer-field/choices "1201f8a0-8495-5147-b800-2b7eb5663d43"] [:db/add "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c" :answer-field/choices "0695697b-3fc8-5062-8203-f0b5c7160dec"] [:db/add "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c" :answer-field/choices "464d337c-a804-57b2-882d-f4c6b2e9fd95"] [:db/add "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c" :answer-field/choices "a6fbb00f-6279-5bf5-b2b1-0b64c6acf7cd"] [:db/add "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c" :answer-field/choices "ac3c879a-436c-5983-88b7-5ba7d1b5b9c3"] [:db/add "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c" :answer-field/correct "0695697b-3fc8-5062-8203-f0b5c7160dec"] [:db/ensure "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "cf5b6133-e53d-57ba-a599-0ba8c32c3771" :question/id #uuid "cf5b6133-e53d-57ba-a599-0ba8c32c3771"] [:db/add "cf5b6133-e53d-57ba-a599-0ba8c32c3771" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}- 2 x - 5 y + z &=-3 \\\\ x + 3 y &=1 \\\\ x + 3 y &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form."] [:db/add "cf5b6133-e53d-57ba-a599-0ba8c32c3771" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-2 & -5 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nFirst reduce the matrix to row echelon form, making each pivot equal to $1$.\n\n$$\nR_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{2}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -5 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_{2}:=R_{2}+\\left(2\\right)R_{1}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_{3}:=R_{3}+\\left(-1\\right)R_{1}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 3 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nIn the row echelon form above, we have only two pivots (in the $1$st and $2$nd columns). To transform the matrix to reduced row echelon form, we need to create zeros above the pivots only.\n\n$$\nR_{1}:=R_{1}+\\left(-3\\right)R_{2}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "cf5b6133-e53d-57ba-a599-0ba8c32c3771" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "cf5b6133-e53d-57ba-a599-0ba8c32c3771" :question/answer-fields "1235ecb1-13a6-5ee4-9b8b-95dc59031b9c"] [:db/ensure "cf5b6133-e53d-57ba-a599-0ba8c32c3771" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096745 :knowledge-point/questions "cf5b6133-e53d-57ba-a599-0ba8c32c3771"] [:db/add "2cc3c278-68e8-5987-b561-2f6167b93610" :answer/id #uuid "2cc3c278-68e8-5987-b561-2f6167b93610"] [:db/add "2cc3c278-68e8-5987-b561-2f6167b93610" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2cc3c278-68e8-5987-b561-2f6167b93610" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 - z \\\\ - z - 1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "2cc3c278-68e8-5987-b561-2f6167b93610" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dff7ee39-af7d-5edb-b0ec-d67bdc9785c0" :answer/id #uuid "dff7ee39-af7d-5edb-b0ec-d67bdc9785c0"] [:db/add "dff7ee39-af7d-5edb-b0ec-d67bdc9785c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dff7ee39-af7d-5edb-b0ec-d67bdc9785c0" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 z - 4 \\\\ - z - 4 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "dff7ee39-af7d-5edb-b0ec-d67bdc9785c0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a997f1b3-4125-5be5-89b9-cbf5ed72fa2d" :answer/id #uuid "a997f1b3-4125-5be5-89b9-cbf5ed72fa2d"] [:db/add "a997f1b3-4125-5be5-89b9-cbf5ed72fa2d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a997f1b3-4125-5be5-89b9-cbf5ed72fa2d" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- z - 4 \\\\ z - 2 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "a997f1b3-4125-5be5-89b9-cbf5ed72fa2d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8176b3e9-8e5e-5d8d-90f2-52b845ec8846" :answer/id #uuid "8176b3e9-8e5e-5d8d-90f2-52b845ec8846"] [:db/add "8176b3e9-8e5e-5d8d-90f2-52b845ec8846" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8176b3e9-8e5e-5d8d-90f2-52b845ec8846" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 - 2 z \\\\ 4 - 3 z \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "8176b3e9-8e5e-5d8d-90f2-52b845ec8846" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b32c5545-d2e7-5a0d-96f3-3cc6ef1bae60" :answer/id #uuid "b32c5545-d2e7-5a0d-96f3-3cc6ef1bae60"] [:db/add "b32c5545-d2e7-5a0d-96f3-3cc6ef1bae60" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b32c5545-d2e7-5a0d-96f3-3cc6ef1bae60" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 z - 3 \\\\ z - 1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "b32c5545-d2e7-5a0d-96f3-3cc6ef1bae60" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6" :answer-field/id #uuid "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6"] [:db/add "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6" :answer-field/choices "2cc3c278-68e8-5987-b561-2f6167b93610"] [:db/add "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6" :answer-field/choices "dff7ee39-af7d-5edb-b0ec-d67bdc9785c0"] [:db/add "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6" :answer-field/choices "a997f1b3-4125-5be5-89b9-cbf5ed72fa2d"] [:db/add "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6" :answer-field/choices "8176b3e9-8e5e-5d8d-90f2-52b845ec8846"] [:db/add "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6" :answer-field/choices "b32c5545-d2e7-5a0d-96f3-3cc6ef1bae60"] [:db/add "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6" :answer-field/correct "b32c5545-d2e7-5a0d-96f3-3cc6ef1bae60"] [:db/ensure "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4fd190cd-08e0-5e19-93c6-a71bdf075fe2" :question/id #uuid "4fd190cd-08e0-5e19-93c6-a71bdf075fe2"] [:db/add "4fd190cd-08e0-5e19-93c6-a71bdf075fe2" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x + 2 y + z &=-5 \\\\ - 3 x - 6 y - 3 z &=15 \\\\ 2 x + 5 y + z &=-11\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "4fd190cd-08e0-5e19-93c6-a71bdf075fe2" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 1 & -5 \\\\ -3 & -6 & -3 & 15 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 1 & -11\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nFirst reduce the matrix to row echelon form, making each pivot equal to $1$.\n\n$$\nR_{2}:=R_{2}+\\left(3\\right)R_{1}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 1 & -11\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_{3}:=R_{3}+\\left(-2\\right)R_{1}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_{2}\\leftrightarrow R_{3}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 1 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nIn the row echelon form above, we have only two pivots (in the $1$st and $2$nd columns). To transform the matrix to reduced row echelon form, we need to create zeros above the pivots only.\n\n$$\nR_{1}:=R_{1}+\\left(-2\\right)R_{2}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & 3 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x + 3 z &=-3 \\\\ y - z &=-1 \\\\ 0 &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe final equation is $0=0$, so it imposes no restriction. The basic variables are $x$ and $y$, and the free variable is $z$. Find $x$ and $y$ in terms of $z$. Therefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=- 3 z - 3 \\\\ y &=z - 1 \\\\ z &=z\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $z$ is an arbitrary real number. In vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}- 3 z - 3 \\\\ z - 1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "4fd190cd-08e0-5e19-93c6-a71bdf075fe2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "4fd190cd-08e0-5e19-93c6-a71bdf075fe2" :question/answer-fields "fcdc134c-c977-5a3a-88a6-9d443522b1f6"] [:db/ensure "4fd190cd-08e0-5e19-93c6-a71bdf075fe2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096745 :knowledge-point/questions "4fd190cd-08e0-5e19-93c6-a71bdf075fe2"] [:db/add "e326647c-e70f-5f7a-a14f-8fa11e253e41" :answer/id #uuid "e326647c-e70f-5f7a-a14f-8fa11e253e41"] [:db/add "e326647c-e70f-5f7a-a14f-8fa11e253e41" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e326647c-e70f-5f7a-a14f-8fa11e253e41" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}z - 3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "e326647c-e70f-5f7a-a14f-8fa11e253e41" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1c684ad0-441c-5903-a00a-1a74cfcccd44" :answer/id #uuid "1c684ad0-441c-5903-a00a-1a74cfcccd44"] [:db/add "1c684ad0-441c-5903-a00a-1a74cfcccd44" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1c684ad0-441c-5903-a00a-1a74cfcccd44" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}z - 2 \\\\ 2 z - 2 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "1c684ad0-441c-5903-a00a-1a74cfcccd44" :answer/validate] [:db/add "859bcd12-37d5-50f6-ae18-1307249f3a7d" :answer/id #uuid "859bcd12-37d5-50f6-ae18-1307249f3a7d"] [:db/add "859bcd12-37d5-50f6-ae18-1307249f3a7d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "859bcd12-37d5-50f6-ae18-1307249f3a7d" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 z - 4 \\\\ 3 - z \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "859bcd12-37d5-50f6-ae18-1307249f3a7d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6c873d9e-102f-5b1d-bfcf-5ba3b2c79ff7" :answer/id #uuid "6c873d9e-102f-5b1d-bfcf-5ba3b2c79ff7"] [:db/add "6c873d9e-102f-5b1d-bfcf-5ba3b2c79ff7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6c873d9e-102f-5b1d-bfcf-5ba3b2c79ff7" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 z + 1 \\\\ z - 2 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "6c873d9e-102f-5b1d-bfcf-5ba3b2c79ff7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "94a72bb3-ccfc-5bab-8410-5f1db29ace94" :answer/id #uuid "94a72bb3-ccfc-5bab-8410-5f1db29ace94"] [:db/add "94a72bb3-ccfc-5bab-8410-5f1db29ace94" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "94a72bb3-ccfc-5bab-8410-5f1db29ace94" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 z + 3 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "94a72bb3-ccfc-5bab-8410-5f1db29ace94" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777" :answer-field/id #uuid "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777"] [:db/add "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777" :answer-field/choices "e326647c-e70f-5f7a-a14f-8fa11e253e41"] [:db/add "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777" :answer-field/choices "1c684ad0-441c-5903-a00a-1a74cfcccd44"] [:db/add "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777" :answer-field/choices "859bcd12-37d5-50f6-ae18-1307249f3a7d"] [:db/add "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777" :answer-field/choices "6c873d9e-102f-5b1d-bfcf-5ba3b2c79ff7"] [:db/add "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777" :answer-field/choices "94a72bb3-ccfc-5bab-8410-5f1db29ace94"] [:db/add "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777" :answer-field/correct "859bcd12-37d5-50f6-ae18-1307249f3a7d"] [:db/ensure "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4c8ac43b-2c41-59b6-a869-1c435f9c6ec4" :question/id #uuid "4c8ac43b-2c41-59b6-a869-1c435f9c6ec4"] [:db/add "4c8ac43b-2c41-59b6-a869-1c435f9c6ec4" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2 x - y - 5 z &=-11 \\\\ x - y - 3 z &=-7 \\\\ 2 y + 2 z &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system."] [:db/add "4c8ac43b-2c41-59b6-a869-1c435f9c6ec4" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}2 & -1 & -5 & -11 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -3 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nFirst reduce the matrix to row echelon form, making each pivot equal to $1$.\n\n$$\nR_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{2}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -3 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -1 & -5 & -11 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_{2}:=R_{2}+\\left(-2\\right)R_{1}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -3 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nR_{3}:=R_{3}+\\left(-2\\right)R_{2}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -3 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nIn the row echelon form above, we have only two pivots (in the $1$st and $2$nd columns). To transform the matrix to reduced row echelon form, we need to create zeros above the pivots only.\n\n$$\nR_{1}:=R_{1}+\\left(1\\right)R_{2}\\qquad M\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 0 & -2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x - 2 z &=-4 \\\\ y + z &=3 \\\\ 0 &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe final equation is $0=0$, so it imposes no restriction. The basic variables are $x$ and $y$, and the free variable is $z$. Find $x$ and $y$ in terms of $z$. Therefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=2 z - 4 \\\\ y &=3 - z \\\\ z &=z\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $z$ is an arbitrary real number. In vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 z - 4 \\\\ 3 - z \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix},\\,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "4c8ac43b-2c41-59b6-a869-1c435f9c6ec4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "4c8ac43b-2c41-59b6-a869-1c435f9c6ec4" :question/answer-fields "a6557f8b-b58c-50a3-9611-dab6bca46777"] [:db/ensure "4c8ac43b-2c41-59b6-a869-1c435f9c6ec4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096745 :knowledge-point/questions "4c8ac43b-2c41-59b6-a869-1c435f9c6ec4"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "3347a82c-790f-5150-8bec-a3bc34ef254e"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/ef/efd26d2bc2a7ec47782275b5ff299b0861808ba1274bc17b483ee76d3e32c300/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186096745 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186096745 :knowledge-point/validate]]
